，高对比度，细腻光影，景深效果，背景虚化，清晰主体，木质家具，红色软垫座椅，细节丰富，纹理清晰，光线柔和，阴影层次分明，构图平衡，人物居中，半身像，七分人像，腰部以上，头部完整，肩部可见，腿部部分入镜，整体色调偏暖，怀旧感，文学气息，知识氛围，安静独处，专注神情，眼神柔和，皮肤白皙，精致五官，立体线条，动态自然，生活化场景，温馨环境，光线混合，冷暖对比，视觉舒适，画面整洁，无杂乱元素，标签总数：50"]},{"id":260,"type":"omni_llm_model_loader","pos":[-2390,1140],"size":[370,280],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"模型文件","localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"model"},"link":null},{"label":"启用多模态","localized_name":"enable_mmproj","name":"enable_mmproj","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"enable_mmproj"},"link":null},{"label":"视觉编码模型","localized_name":"mmproj","name":"mmproj","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"mmproj"},"link":null},{"label":"启用ASR","localized_name":"enable_asr","name":"enable_asr","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"enable_asr"},"link":null},{"label":"上下文长度","localized_name":"n_ctx","name":"n_ctx","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"n_ctx"},"link":null},{"label":"GPU模型层数","localized_name":"n_gpu_layers","name":"n_gpu_layers","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"n_gpu_layers"},"link":null},{"label":"显存限制（GB）","localized_name":"vram_limit","name":"vram_limit","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"vram_limit"},"link":null},{"label":"图片最大编码token数","localized_name":"image_max_tokens","name":"image_max_tokens","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"image_max_tokens"},"link":null},{"label":"注意力类型","localized_name":"attention_type","name":"attention_type","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"attention_type"},"link":null},{"label":"Tensor分割比例","localized_name":"tensor_split","name":"tensor_split","shape":7,"type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"tensor_split"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"Llama模型","localized_name":"llama_model","name":"llama_model","type":"LLAMACPPMODEL","links":[439]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"omni_llm_model_loader","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.8"}},"widgets_values":["Qwen3.5-9B-uncensored-heretic-v2/Qwen3.5-9B-uncensored-heretic-v2-Q4_K_M.gguf",true,"Qwen3.5-9B-